#. module: printing_label_format
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:printing_label_format.field_printing_printer__label_format
msgid ""
"Format this printer is able to render. A printer only ever takes one format, "
"so a report is only ever sent to a printer declared for its own. Leave empty "
"only for a printer that no report is ever sent to."
msgstr ""
"Le format que cette imprimante est en mesure d'imprimer. Une imprimante ne "
"peut imprimer qu'un seul format."

